==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar|en}} {{term|sc=Arab|حماس|tr=ḥamās|lang=ar|lit=enthusiasm}}, an acronym for {{term|lang=ar|حركة المقاومة الاسلامية|tr=ḥarakat al-muqāwama al-islāmīya||Islamic Resistance Movement}}.

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# A [[militant]] [[Sunni]] [[Islamic]] movement that presses for an [[independent]] [[Palestinian]] [[state]] and [[abnegate]]s the [[recognition]] of the state of [[Israel]]: often labeled a [[terrorist]] organization.

